==============================================================================
CLAIM A1 -- IS LINE 31 EXECUTED?  (this is what 'unreachable' would mean)
==============================================================================
Method: sys.settrace, line-level, recording every line number executed INSIDE
preprocess_output. If 31 never appears, the line is unreachable/dead code.
If it appears, 'unreachable' is factually wrong however true the rest may be.

  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='kitchen Question: Where is Mary? Answer: garden'
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='kitchen. Question: Where is Mary?'
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='plain kitchen'
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input=''
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='QUESTION'
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='Question'
  lines=[25, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32]  line31_executed=True   input='İıΣẞ kitchen Question'

  inputs where line 31 executed: 7/7
  VERDICT A1: 'line 31 is UNREACHABLE' -> REFUTED (the line executes every time)

